title: "spiking-ven: a spiking sparse auditory encoder and vocal error network"
abstract: >-
  A spiking implementation of sparse auditory encoding and predictive cancellation
  of self-generated song in the zebra finch, and the spiking counterpart to the
  rate-based vocal error network of Gong et al. 2026.
